{"ref":"BDB, נְהָרָה","hw":"נְהָרָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נְהָרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. light, daylight</strong> (as Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">נְהוֹרָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܽܘܗܪܳܐ</span> m.);—<span dir=\"rtl\">וְאַל־תּוֹפַע עָלָיו נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:4\" href=\"/Job.3.4\">Jb 3:4</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹשֶׁךְ</span>).","next":"BDB, מִנְהָרָה²","prev":"BDB, נָהַר²"}